WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:19.195
Yoo-hoo! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.196 --> 00:00:22.556
I'm a giraffe.

3
00:00:22.557 --> 00:00:28.544
Giraffes are the tallest land mammals on earth.

4
00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:31.359
Where do you live?

5
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:35.580
We live only in Africa.

6
00:00:35.581 --> 00:00:41.238
We like grasslands and forests.

7
00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:45.504
You have really long legs!

8
00:00:45.505 --> 00:00:51.247
Yes, we can run really fast.

9
00:00:51.248 --> 00:00:57.138
And we look for food all day long.

10
00:00:57.139 --> 00:01:03.558
Our long legs help us roam the grasslands.

11
00:01:03.559 --> 00:01:07.390
Your neck is long too.

12
00:01:07.391 --> 00:01:12.534
We look for food in very tall trees.

13
00:01:12.535 --> 00:01:20.756
We can reach food with our long necks.

14
00:01:20.757 --> 00:01:23.815
What do you eat?

15
00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:28.684
We eat leaves and buds.

16
00:01:28.685 --> 00:01:33.773
Our favorite leaves have lots of water.

17
00:01:33.774 --> 00:01:38.497
So we don't need to drink often.

18
00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:42.050
Do all giraffes look alike?

19
00:01:42.051 --> 00:01:47.771
Well, all giraffes have coats with spots.

20
00:01:47.772 --> 00:01:52.401
But our coats have different patterns.

21
00:01:52.402 --> 00:01:57.626
That makes every giraffe look different.

22
00:01:57.627 --> 00:02:00.342
How do you sleep?

23
00:02:00.343 --> 00:02:04.726
We usually sleep standing up.

24
00:02:04.727 --> 00:02:12.984
We take just a short nap each day.

25
00:02:12.985 --> 00:02:17.497
I see a tasty leaf. Bye.

26
00:02:17.498 --> 00:02:25.648
Good-bye, Giraffe!
